Rules:
- Integers only. No half points.
- Be calibrated: 5 = professional human translator quality; 3 = usable but
  noticeably imperfect; 1 = unusable.
- Do NOT reveal in any rationale which side is "A", "B", or "C"; just
  describe what's good or bad about each.
- Treat near-identical translations independently — do not flatten scores
  just because the outputs are similar.
- Output JSON only. No markdown fences, no prose outside the JSON.
